# Messages editor

## Architecture

- **Storage**: zero-width delimiters (`\u200B` + label + `\u200C`) via `friendlyToken()` in `notificationTemplates.ts`
- **Display**: contenteditable with `data-msg-token` spans (`messageEditorDom.ts`) — WYSIWYG; no overlay
- **Round-trip**: `storageToEditorHtml` / `editorDomToStorage`; newlines as `<br>` in HTML

## Placeholders

- Add new details in `PLACEHOLDER_LABELS`, `LABEL_TO_VAR`, `MESSAGE_INSERT_TAGS`, `MESSAGE_PREVIEW_SAMPLE`, and pass vars in `email.ts`
- Editor shows underlined labels only — no visible `**` in the UI

## Token behaviour

- Delete removes whole placeholder (Backspace/Delete beside token span)
- `migrateTokensToStorageFormat` on load/save for legacy `**` markers
- Run `npm run test:messages` after changes

## Previews

- Email/SMS preview uses `previewMessage` / `previewEmailHtml` with sample vars — not editor HTML
